###### CUSTOMERS — modul customer (CustomerController) ######
### Base: {{baseUrl}}/customers
### Member loyalty + snapshot nama di order (orders.customerId → customers.id).
### Guest tetap bisa order dengan customerId=null.
### CATATAN: DTO CustomerRegisterRequest / CustomerClaimRequest ada di kode
### tapi route POST /register dan POST /{id}/claim BELUM ADA di controller
### saat ini — jangan coba sebelum diimplementasikan.

### Create member (tanpa login-akun) — authority customer.create
POST {{baseUrl}}/customers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Budi Santoso",
    "email": "budi@example.com",
    "phone": "081234567890",
    "notes": "Langganan kopi tubruk"
}

### Search active or GetAll — authority customer.read
### filter: keyword (name/email/phone); default sort createdAt,desc
GET {{baseUrl}}/customers?keyword=budi
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Search - pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/customers?page=0&size=5&sort=createdAt,desc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get by ID — authority customer.read
GET {{baseUrl}}/customers/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Full update (PUT) — authority customer.update, profil saja (tidak mengubah akun)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/customers/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Budi Santoso",
    "email": "budi@example.com",
    "phone": "081234567890",
    "notes": "Langganan kopi tubruk"
}

### Partial update (PATCH) — authority customer.update, minimal satu field terisi
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/customers/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "phone": "081999888777"
}

### Delete (soft delete) — authority customer.delete, response 204; akun auth_users tidak ikut terhapus
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/customers/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ========================================
### VALIDATION
### ========================================

### Get by ID - not found (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/customers/999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Patch kosong (400 "PATCH can't be empty")
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/customers/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
}
